<title>JAPAN: Silver Seiko -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Silver Seiko -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.37		vs	    3.65</p>
<p> Operating   loss 222    million	  vs   loss 281    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 181    million	  vs   loss 191    million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 29    million	  vs   loss 222    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 0.48 yen	  vs     loss 3.69 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     60 million	  vs	  60 million</p>
<p> Interim div		  --	  vs		    --</p>
<p>NOTE - Silver Seiko Ltd makes home-use knitting machines.</p>
